    title: "elixir: the elixir spellings of BEAM sends and spawns are unrowed (Kernel.send/spawn incl. the bare forms, Process.spawn/exit/link/monitor/register, GenServer.reply/start/stop, Task.Supervisor.async*) while erlang rows them process_send"  # d204
